{"4065490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Hope: Exodus", "steam_appid": 4065490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world swallowed by infection, survival is no longer about saving humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about saving one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning, you leave the safety of your underground shelter and step into a collapsing world of fog, silence, and the dead. Food is running out. Medicine is scarce. The infection spreads every night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And back home, your wife is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search abandoned homes, scavenge ruined streets, and push deeper into infected zones while the world grows more dangerous with every sunset. What you bring back determines whether she survives another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But surviving the night is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the infection spreads across the map, safe areas fall, supply routes disappear, and the world slowly turns against you. Every decision matters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >risk the hospital for medicine,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >search the town for food,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or defend the last safe place you still call home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about being a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about how far someone will go for the person they refuse to lose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric FPS zombie survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day and night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for food and supplies to keep your wife alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding infection system that changes the world over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense exploration through fog-covered towns and abandoned locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited weapons and resource-focused survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional survival gameplay centered around protecting the last person you love</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She’s the reason you keep fighting.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world swallowed by infection, survival is no longer about saving humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about saving one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning, you leave the safety of your underground shelter and step into a collapsing world of fog, silence, and the dead. Food is running out. Medicine is scarce. The infection spreads every night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And back home, your wife is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search abandoned homes, scavenge ruined streets, and push deeper into infected zones while the world grows more dangerous with every sunset. What you bring back determines whether she survives another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But surviving the night is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the infection spreads across the map, safe areas fall, supply routes disappear, and the world slowly turns against you. Every decision matters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >risk the hospital for medicine,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >search the town for food,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or defend the last safe place you still call home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about being a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about how far someone will go for the person they refuse to lose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric FPS zombie survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day and night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"